---
title: "SEO & AI Search for Small Businesses"
description: "Get found on Google and named by ChatGPT. A free website, local SEO across Google, Yelp, Apple Maps, Nextdoor and Bing, and monthly content in your own voice, for small businesses with a physical location."
permalink: /seo/
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block styles %}
  .offer { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 28px 80px; }

  .offer-flag { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .offer h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.1rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.06; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .offer-lede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.65; max-width: 54ch; }

  .offer h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--ink); margin: 52px 0 8px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .offer p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 16px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .section-note { color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }

  .diy { background: var(--warm); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 18px 22px; margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: none; }
  .diy b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  .menu { display: grid; }
  .mrow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; column-gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; padding: 16px 0 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .mrow .item { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }
  .mrow .price { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .mrow .price small { color: var(--ink-mute); font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .mrow .desc { grid-column: 1 / 2; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.93rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-top: 4px; max-width: 56ch; }
  .mrow.free .price { color: var(--accent); }

  .bundles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .bundle { background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px 24px; box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(21, 36, 61, 0.06); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .bundle.pick { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(216, 85, 44, 0.12); }
  .bundle .nm { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .bundle .pr { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1; margin: 12px 0 2px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bundle .per { color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .bundle ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .bundle li { padding-left: 18px; position: relative; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.5; }
  .bundle li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.5em; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .bundle li.hd { padding-left: 0; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; }
  .bundle li.hd::before { display: none; }

  .cta-card { background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 30px; margin-top: 48px; box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(21, 36, 61, 0.06); }
  .cta-card h3 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .cta-card p { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .cta-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .cta-btn:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

  .fineprint { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-mute); line-height: 1.65; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 18px; max-width: none; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .offer { padding: 36px 20px 60px; }
    .bundle .pr { font-size: 1.9rem; }
  }
  .bundle .pr small { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-mute); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .bundles.two { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<div class="offer">

  <div class="offer-flag">SEO &amp; AI search for small businesses</div>
  <h1>Get found on Google. Get named by AI.</h1>
  <p class="offer-lede">A customer asks her phone who to call, and something answers with three names. That answer gets assembled from your Google profile, Yelp, Apple Maps, Bing, Nextdoor and your own website. Most small businesses are missing from half of them, or say something different on each.</p>
  <p class="offer-lede" style="margin-top:14px">We build the site, fix every listing so they all agree, and keep publishing the pages your customers are actually searching for, so Google ranks you and AI assistants like ChatGPT and Google's AI answers name you.</p>

  <h2>1. Your website, built free</h2>
  <p class="section-note">A $6,000 build, included at no charge with the plan.</p>
  <div class="menu">
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">A full professional website</span>
      <div class="desc">Custom-designed around how your business actually sells. Home, About, a page for each core service, Gallery and Contact. Written so an AI assistant can lift a paragraph and still name you.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">A page for every area you serve</span>
      <div class="desc">One page per suburb or town, each with a real job in it: photos, what it involved, something true about the place. Thin copies with the town name swapped get a whole site held down, so we don't build those.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>2. Local SEO and AI search</h2>
  <p class="section-note">Tied to a physical location. Google and the other listings require a real address.</p>
  <div class="menu">
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">Google Business Profile, set up and optimized</span>
      <div class="desc">Categories, services, hours, photos and Q&amp;A, built so you rank higher on Google Maps. We coach you through verification and keep it current.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">Every listing saying the same thing</span>
      <div class="desc">Google, Yelp, Apple Maps, Nextdoor and Bing, all with the same name, number and address. AI assistants cross-check these against each other, and a business that doesn't match reads as one nobody can verify.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">AI search optimization</span>
      <div class="desc">Your site and listings structured for Google's AI answers, and the groundwork laid for ChatGPT. Nobody can promise you the number one spot in ChatGPT, because there isn't one. What we can do is make you the business it has the most reasons to name.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>3. Content in your own voice</h2>
  <p class="section-note">The part that keeps working after the setup is done.</p>
  <div class="menu">
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">A monthly strategy call</span>
      <div class="desc">30 to 60 minutes with you, the owner. What customers get wrong, the job that went sideways, when you'd tell someone not to hire you. That conversation is why none of the content reads like a machine wrote it.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">2 to 3 new pages a month</span>
      <div class="desc">Each one aimed at something local customers are actually searching for, using the keyword data for your area, not guesses.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Add-on: a CRM</h2>
  <p class="section-note">Not included in the plan pricing below. Priced separately, as a monthly add-on.</p>
  <div class="menu">
    <div class="mrow">
      <span class="item">Every lead tracked, setup included</span>
      <div class="desc">From first call to paid invoice, so the new leads don't fall through the cracks. Add it to either plan, any month, for an extra monthly fee. Ask about it on the call.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Pricing</h2>
  <p class="section-note">One plan, everything in sections 1 to 3 included. The CRM add-on is extra. Six month minimum, because that's how long search takes to show consistent, measurable results.</p>
  <div class="bundles two">
    <div class="bundle">
      <div class="nm">Standard</div>
      <div class="pr">$2,900<small>/mo</small></div>
      <div class="per">Six month minimum</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Website built free, plus a page for every area you serve</li>
        <li>Google Business Profile and all five listings</li>
        <li>AI search optimization</li>
        <li>Monthly strategy call</li>
        <li>2 to 3 new pages a month</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bundle pick">
      <div class="nm">Members</div>
      <div class="pr">$2,600<small>/mo</small></div>
      <div class="per">Exclusive to partner communities &middot; six month minimum</div>
      <ul>
        <li class="hd">Everything in Standard</li>
        <li>$300 a month less, $1,800 over the six months</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-card">
    <h3>Book a 20-minute call</h3>
    <p>Bring three numbers: your average job, roughly how many jobs you closed last month, and the towns you want to win. I'll pull the search data for your area and tell you straight whether this is worth it for you before you spend anything.</p>
    <a class="cta-btn" href="https://cal.com/dhruvkar">Book a call &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <p class="fineprint">You own your domain, your profiles, your accounts and your customer list from day one. Nothing goes live in your name that you haven't read.</p>

</div>
{% endblock %}
